<title>UK: CRICKET-GLAMORGAN 155-3 V AUSTRALIA (369-4 DEC) - LUNCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-GLAMORGAN 155-3 V AUSTRALIA (369-4 DEC) - LUNCH.</headline>
<dateline>CARDIFF 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glamorgan, replying to</p>
<p>Australia's first innings score of 369 for four declared, were</p>
<p>155 for three at lunch on the second day of the three-day tour</p>
<p>match on Thursday.</p>
</text>
